<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  FTA408 Pre-Billing Report (FTA685) — ported from the legacy Jasper Server report
  (fta-archive: JCRS/FTA/Reports/FTA/FTA408-PreBilling). Changes from legacy:
   - no query: the backend supplies the rows (PreBillingReport ports FTAR408P and its
     FTAR408_* functions);
   - the error summary subreport (FTA408_PreBilling_Errors) gets its rows and compiled
     report as parameters (ERRORS, ERRORS_SUBREPORT) instead of re-querying FTAR408P_ERRORS;
   - the no-data header's fta_current_server subreport is the CURRENT_SERVER parameter;
   - the Jasper Server parameters (LoggedInUser, ROOT_DIR, SUBREPORT_DIR/EXT) are gone.
-->
